{"id": "99046", "title": "银川市兴庆区农产品物资储备集散中心项目招标公告", "sourceUrl": "https://ggzyjy.fzggw.nx.gov.cn/dzjy/001001/001001001/001001001001/20260629/1232cb3e-4a09-4786-b812-8d96eaebab54.html", "date": "2026-06-29", "source": "宁夏公共资源交易中心", "content": "<div>\n<h2><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><strong><span>招标条件</span></strong></h2><p><span>本招标项目</span><span><span>银川市兴庆区农产品物资储备集散中心项目</span></span><span>已由</span><span><span>银川市兴庆区发展和改革局</span></span><span>以</span><span><span>关于</span></span><span><span>银川市兴庆区农产品物资储备集散中心项目</span></span><span><span>初步设计的批复</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>银兴发改发</span><span>[202</span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>]1</span></span><span><span>27</span></span><span><span>号</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>文件</span></span><span>批准建设，项目业主为</span><span><span>银川市兴庆区商务和投资促进局</span></span><span>，建设资金来自</span><span><span>申请地方政府专项债券资金</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>不足部分通过争取专项资金、招商引资、项目运营等方式予以解决。</span></span><span>招标人为</span><span><span>银川市兴庆区商务和投资促进局</span></span><span>。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目施工进行公开招标。</span></p><p><span><span>宁夏博盛项目管理有限公司</span></span><span>受招标人委托负责本工程的招标事宜。</span></p><h2><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><strong><span>项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></h2><p><span>2.1</span><span>项目概况：</span><span><span><span>项目总用地面积</span><span>95784.99平方米（约143.68亩），总建筑面积38751.0平方米，规划建设蔬菜分集散中心（货棚）、多功能物资分集散中心、冷藏库、两栋配套服务用房、精品果蔬分集散中心、副食品分集散中心、粮油分集散中心、综合中心共九个单体建筑。主要功能涵盖现代农产品流通、仓储用房、集散中心、配套服务用房等，拟配套智慧仓储、智慧冷链、农产品快速检测、数据中心等设施。</span></span></span></p><p><span>2.2</span><span>建设地点：</span><span><span>银川市兴庆区贺兰山路南侧，新燕路西侧，雷祖庙以北，京藏高速以东</span></span></p><p><span>2.3</span><span>计划工期：</span><span><span>365</span></span><span><span>日历天</span></span></p><p><span>2.4</span><span>招标范围：</span><span><span>招标文件及工程量清单要求的所有范围</span></span></p><p><span>2.5</span><span>标段划分</span><span>：</span><span><span>本项目</span></span><span><span>不</span></span><span><span>划分标段</span></span></p><h2><strong><span><span>3.</span></span></strong><strong><span>投标人资格要求</span></strong></h2><p><span>3.1</span><span>本次招标要求投标人具备独立法人资格，且同时具有</span><span><span>建筑工程施工</span></span><span><span>总承包</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>级</span></span><span><span>及以上</span></span><span>资质</span><span><span>，</span>\n</span><span>并在人员、设备、资金等方面具有相应的施工能力，其中，投标人拟派项目经理须具备</span><span><span>建筑工程施工</span></span><span><span>专业二级及以上</span></span><span><span>注册建造师执业资格</span></span><span>，具备有效的安全生产考核合格证书，且未担任其他在施建设工程项目的项目经理。</span></p><p><span>3.2</span><span>本次招标</span><span><span>不接受</span></span><span>联合体投标。</span></p><h2><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><strong><span>招标文件的获取</span></strong></h2><p><span>4.1</span><span>凡有意参加投标者，请于</span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>\n<span>6 </span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span>\n<span>29 </span></span></span><span>日</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>时</span><span><span>00</span></span><span>分至</span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>\n<span>7 </span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span>\n<span>6 </span></span></span><span>日</span><span><span>23</span></span><span>时</span><span><span>59</span></span><span>分（北京时间，下同），登录</span><span><span>“宁夏回族自治区公共资源交易平台”（以下简称“电子交易平台”）</span></span><span>免费下载电子版招标文件。联合体投标的，由联合体牵头人下载招标文件。</span></p><p><span>4.2</span><span>“电子交易平台”实行</span><span>CA数字证书安全登录管理。</span></p><h2><strong><span><span>5.</span></span></strong><strong><span>投标文件的递交</span></strong></h2><p><span>5.1</span><span>投标文件递交的截</span><span>止</span><span>时间（投标截止时间，下同）</span><span>为</span><span>2</span><span>026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日</span><span>9</span><span>时</span><span>00</span><span><span>分，投标人应在截止时间前通过</span><span>“电子交易平台”递交电子投标文件。</span></span></p><p><span>5.2</span><span><span>逾期送达的投标文件，</span><span>“电子交易平台”将予以拒收。</span></span></p><h2><strong><span><span>6.</span></span></strong><strong><span>发布公告的媒介</span></strong></h2><p><span>本次招标公告在</span><span><span>“宁夏回族自治区公共资源交易网”、“中国招标投标公共服务平台”</span></span><span>上发布。</span></p><h2><strong><span>7.本项目招标投标监督部门为：银川市住房和城乡建设局，联系电话：0951-5556782。</span></strong></h2><h2><strong><span>8.</span></strong><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></h2><p><span>招标人：</span><span><span>银川市兴庆区商务和投资促进局</span></span><span>招标代理机构：</span><span><span>宁夏博盛项目管理有限公司</span></span></p><p><span>地址：</span><span><span>银川市兴庆区</span></span><span>            地址：</span><span><span>宁夏银川市兴庆区民族南街240号光耀大厦6楼A617室</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮</span>\n<span>编：</span></span><span><span>750000</span></span><span><span>邮</span>\n<span>编：</span>\n</span><span><span>750000</span></span></p><p><span><span>联</span>\n<span>系</span>\n<span>人：</span></span><span><span>杜晓博</span></span><span><span>联系人：</span>\n</span><span><span><span>王耀（项目负责人）</span>\n<span>王庆</span>\n<span>周晓佳</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>电</span>\n<span>话：</span></span><span><span>0951-6720079</span></span><span><span>电</span>\n<span>话：</span></span><span><span>0951-8626031  18095519649</span></span></p><p><span><span>传</span>\n<span>真：</span></span><span><span>\n<span>\n</span></span></span><span><span>传</span>\n<span>真：</span></span><span><span>\n<span>\n</span></span></span></p><p><span>电子邮件：</span><span><span>\n<span>\n</span></span></span><span>\n<span>电子邮件：</span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span>                                      2026年6月29日</span><strong><span><br/></span></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n<div>\n<p>\n<a href=\"javascript:void(0);\">[A6400000141101081001001]银川市兴庆区农产品物资储备集散中心项目.NXZF</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>\n<a href=\"javascript:void(0);\">招标人信用承诺书.pdf</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>\n<a href=\"javascript:void(0);\">招标公告.pdf</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "html": "", "method": "招标公告", "region": "宁夏", "buyer": "招标人", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://ggzyjy.fzggw.nx.gov.cn/EWB-FRONT